                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Draper to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-03-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 18,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Draper acknowledges receipt of telegraphic instructions of the 16th instant,
                    and reports that arrangements will be made as directed.)</p>
            </div>
